---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Email Selected by Men for corrections, product suggestions, and questions. There is no form."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-6xl">
      Contact
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Corrections, product suggestions, and questions go to email. We read
      everything. We do not promise a same-day reply.
    </p>
    <dl class="mt-12 space-y-8 text-sm">
      <div>
        <dt class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">
          Email
        </dt>
        <dd class="mt-2">
          <a class="text-lg text-ink hover:text-gold" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
            {site.email}
          </a>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">
          Corrections
        </dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 max-w-md text-ink-soft">
          If a spec, a price band, or a ranking is wrong, say so. Factual errors
          get a fix and a new updated date. How that works is on <a class="text-gold hover:text-ink" href="/standards/">Standards</a>.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">
          Product pitches
        </dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 max-w-md text-ink-soft">
          If you want a product considered, send the facts: price, materials,
          where it is made, and why it belongs here. Photos help. Hype does not.
          Unsolicited boxes do not get a review. Payment does not buy a ranking.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
